WEBVTT

00:00:02.683 --> 00:00:03.893
Yeah, yeah, got it.

00:00:04.226 --> 00:00:06.020
(straining)

00:00:06.354 --> 00:00:08.147
(humming)

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:09.565
Mm-mm-mm.

00:00:09.649 --> 00:00:11.609
You all got some ugly goldfish.

00:00:11.692 --> 00:00:14.070
(grunts)
Come on, a little more.

00:00:14.153 --> 00:00:15.655
(grunts)

00:00:16.238 --> 00:00:17.573
(wood creaking)

00:00:17.657 --> 00:00:19.700
(straining)

00:00:21.035 --> 00:00:22.495
Hmm?
No!

00:00:23.537 --> 00:00:24.372
(grunting)

00:00:24.455 --> 00:00:25.706
Yeah!

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:26.791
Extinct that mammoth!

00:00:26.874 --> 00:00:29.377
Come on, Manny,
kick his monkey butt!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.711
Look at you.

00:00:31.045 --> 00:00:33.422
11 tons of
landlubber blubber!

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:35.341
Hey, I'm not fat.

00:00:35.424 --> 00:00:36.842
I'm poufy!

00:00:36.926 --> 00:00:39.053
Too bad, tubby,
I could have used you.

00:00:39.136 --> 00:00:40.054
(grunts)

00:00:40.137 --> 00:00:41.222
Ain't gonna happen, Cap'n.

00:00:41.305 --> 00:00:42.139
(grunts)

00:00:44.141 --> 00:00:45.309
(screams)

00:00:47.019 --> 00:00:47.979
Uh-oh.

00:00:48.062 --> 00:00:48.938
Whoo!

00:00:49.021 --> 00:00:50.690
I got you, Granny.
(grunts)

00:00:50.773 --> 00:00:52.066
Giddy up. Let's go. Let's go!

00:00:52.149 --> 00:00:53.150
Ouch! Ow!

00:00:53.234 --> 00:00:54.610
(chittering)

00:00:54.694 --> 00:00:56.153
(screams)

00:00:56.237 --> 00:00:57.071
(yells)

00:00:57.154 --> 00:00:58.948
(animals screaming)

00:00:59.031 --> 00:01:00.950
Does anyone have floaties?!

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:02.618
-Ow!
-Ah!

00:01:02.702 --> 00:01:04.578
(gasps)

00:01:05.371 --> 00:01:07.206
No! No!

00:01:07.289 --> 00:01:08.624
My bounty!

00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:10.251
Whoa! Oh, whoa! Whoa!

00:01:10.334 --> 00:01:11.669
(growls)

00:01:15.715 --> 00:01:17.216
(grunts)

00:01:21.971 --> 00:01:23.764
(gasping)

00:01:24.473 --> 00:01:26.267
They sunk our battleship.

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:27.518
What are we going to do?

00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:28.686
We're all gonna drown.

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.189
You're a sea creature,
you idiot.

00:01:32.273 --> 00:01:33.482
Oh. (chuckles)

00:01:33.566 --> 00:01:34.775
Good point, sir.

00:01:35.609 --> 00:01:36.986
Should I fly the white, Captain?

00:01:37.069 --> 00:01:38.946
-No!
-FLYNN: Wait.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:40.948
-What about Shira?
-What about her?

00:01:41.032 --> 00:01:42.324
Yeah, what about her?

00:01:42.408 --> 00:01:45.286
Anyone else want
to play captain?

00:01:45.369 --> 00:01:46.829
-(whimpers)
-Good.

00:01:46.912 --> 00:01:48.706
GUTT: Now, come on,
blubber-brain.

00:01:48.789 --> 00:01:49.915
Swim.

00:01:50.958 --> 00:01:52.001
(coughing)

00:01:52.084 --> 00:01:53.002
Hey!

00:01:53.085 --> 00:01:54.587
Gutt! Flynn!

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:55.504
Anyone there?

00:01:55.588 --> 00:01:57.173
Here, grab hold.

00:01:57.256 --> 00:01:58.549
No, go away.

00:01:59.175 --> 00:02:00.134
I'd rather drown.

00:02:00.217 --> 00:02:01.594
Whatever the lady wants.

00:02:02.136 --> 00:02:03.554
(gasping)

00:02:04.388 --> 00:02:05.556
(coughing)

00:02:06.474 --> 00:02:08.601
I said I didn't need your help.

00:02:08.684 --> 00:02:09.810
You're welcome.

00:02:09.894 --> 00:02:12.605
So, care to join
our scurvy crew?

00:02:12.688 --> 00:02:14.065
(coughing)

00:02:14.148 --> 00:02:16.233
Two sloths, a mammoth,
and a saber?

00:02:16.317 --> 00:02:18.486
You guys are like the start
of a bad joke.

00:02:18.569 --> 00:02:20.237
And we saved you.

00:02:20.321 --> 00:02:21.989
That makes you
the punch line, kitty.

00:02:22.073 --> 00:02:23.282
(growls)

00:02:23.365 --> 00:02:25.284
Don't call me kitty.

00:02:25.367 --> 00:02:26.911
Okay, I won't.

00:02:27.703 --> 00:02:28.704
Kitty.

00:02:28.788 --> 00:02:30.414
If they kiss,
I'm going to puke.

00:02:30.498 --> 00:02:32.583
What? Huh?
Wait. No.

00:02:38.839 --> 00:02:40.925
MALE: My hoofs are killing me.

00:02:41.008 --> 00:02:43.177
FEMALE: I want a snack.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:45.888
MALE: I was built
for speed, not distance.

00:02:45.971 --> 00:02:48.057
I'm so tired of smelling
this tail in front of me.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:49.809
FEMALE: Can't we just go home?

00:02:49.892 --> 00:02:51.519
CHILD: Are we there yet?

00:02:51.602 --> 00:02:53.187
We've been walking all day.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.688
(grunting)

00:02:54.772 --> 00:02:56.690
MALE: I don't think
we're ever going to get there.

00:02:56.774 --> 00:02:57.858
(moaning and groaning)

00:02:57.942 --> 00:02:59.777
Maybe we should rest
for a few hours.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.779
-(all sigh)
-Thank you.

00:03:01.862 --> 00:03:03.072
(sighing)

00:03:03.656 --> 00:03:05.407
(yawns)

00:03:05.491 --> 00:03:06.909
Night, Ellie.

00:03:07.576 --> 00:03:09.036
(snoring)

00:03:13.499 --> 00:03:14.500
(sighs)

00:03:14.917 --> 00:03:16.502
I miss you, Dad.

00:03:18.337 --> 00:03:20.256
Well, that's something
you don't see every day.

00:03:20.339 --> 00:03:21.799
(gasps) Ethan!

00:03:22.341 --> 00:03:23.592
-Hi. (gasps, yells)
-(branch snapping)

00:03:23.676 --> 00:03:25.010
Whoa! Ow. Ooh.

00:03:25.094 --> 00:03:26.137
(blows)

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:27.513
-Meant to do that.
-(chuckles)

00:03:28.139 --> 00:03:30.349
I've never seen a mammoth
sleep like that.

00:03:30.432 --> 00:03:32.685
What? No. This just
helps me think.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:34.645
It gets blood
to the old noggin

00:03:34.728 --> 00:03:36.730
and away from the
old... whatever.

00:03:37.189 --> 00:03:38.399
(laughs)

00:03:38.482 --> 00:03:39.942
(chuckling)
Uh, okay.

00:03:40.401 --> 00:03:41.902
That's a little weird.

00:03:41.986 --> 00:03:43.946
(rumbling in distance)

00:03:46.866 --> 00:03:48.617
So, how you doing?

00:03:48.951 --> 00:03:50.452
You know, with all of this.

00:03:50.536 --> 00:03:52.872
Honestly, a little scared.

00:03:53.622 --> 00:03:55.207
Okay, a lot scared.

00:03:55.833 --> 00:03:57.334
Everything we knew is gone.

00:03:57.418 --> 00:03:59.170
Yeah, I was pretty scared, too.

00:03:59.253 --> 00:04:02.965
I mean, not scared, but,
you know, like, concerned.

00:04:04.216 --> 00:04:05.926
Hey, uh, do you want to walk
with me tomorrow?

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.095
Try and get our minds
off all this stuff?

00:04:08.179 --> 00:04:09.388
You want to walk with me?

00:04:09.889 --> 00:04:11.932
Well, you did almost flatten me
this morning,

00:04:12.016 --> 00:04:15.186
so I figure it can't really
go worse than that, right?

00:04:15.269 --> 00:04:16.812
(chuckles) Yeah.

00:04:16.896 --> 00:04:18.022
Oh, just one thing.

00:04:18.105 --> 00:04:19.815
Totally no
big deal, but...

00:04:20.232 --> 00:04:21.984
you might want to
lose the molehog.

00:04:22.067 --> 00:04:23.903
Louis? Yeah, sure.

00:04:23.986 --> 00:04:25.070
Not a problem.

00:04:28.282 --> 00:04:29.658
(sighs)

00:04:29.742 --> 00:04:30.826
Wow.

00:04:31.702 --> 00:04:33.245
Someone looks happy.

00:04:33.329 --> 00:04:34.288
(sighs)

00:04:34.371 --> 00:04:35.789
Ethan's great, isn't he?

00:04:35.873 --> 00:04:38.250
Baby, I know you
like this one,

00:04:38.334 --> 00:04:42.129
but just don't let anyone
change who you are, okay?

00:04:42.213 --> 00:04:43.422
I know.

00:04:46.508 --> 00:04:47.718
You coming up?

00:04:51.222 --> 00:04:53.766
I think I'm going to sleep
down here tonight.

00:04:53.849 --> 00:04:54.975
Okay.

00:04:55.809 --> 00:04:57.019
Night, baby.

00:04:57.436 --> 00:04:58.646
Night, Mom.

00:05:00.439 --> 00:05:01.732
Night, Dad.

00:05:07.029 --> 00:05:09.865
(grunting)

00:05:13.577 --> 00:05:15.913
Hey, chew this
sandwich for me.

00:05:16.914 --> 00:05:19.458
Granny, why didn't
our family want us?

00:05:19.541 --> 00:05:20.793
What's wrong with us?

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.795
Ah, they think
we're screw-ups.

00:05:22.878 --> 00:05:24.338
That we can't do
anything right.

00:05:24.713 --> 00:05:25.965
(grunts)

00:05:26.048 --> 00:05:27.424
-(screams)
-Aah!

00:05:27.508 --> 00:05:28.425
It's a rat!

00:05:28.884 --> 00:05:30.594
(grunting)

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:31.804
(gasps)

00:05:31.887 --> 00:05:33.138
(yelling)

00:05:33.222 --> 00:05:34.348
No! No! Aah!

00:05:36.058 --> 00:05:36.892
Screw-up.

00:05:36.976 --> 00:05:39.061
-Oh, Sid. Ow!
-Ow!

00:05:39.144 --> 00:05:40.896
We'll never make it home
on this thing.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.815
Oh, well, maybe you should
have thought of that

00:05:42.898 --> 00:05:45.067
before you capsized
our berg, genius.

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.777
-Yeah, trying to escape.
-Wimp.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:47.695
-Whiner.
-Crybaby.

00:05:47.778 --> 00:05:49.363
-Land!
-Yeah, land.

00:05:49.446 --> 00:05:50.990
-Wait. What?
-MANNY: Not her.

00:05:51.073 --> 00:05:52.408
-There!
-Wha...?

00:05:52.491 --> 00:05:53.450
MANNY: Land!

00:05:56.161 --> 00:05:58.789
-Everyone, paddle! Paddle!
-(Sid grunting, panting)

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.298
(exotic birdcalls)

00:06:15.014 --> 00:06:16.515
(grunts)

00:06:16.598 --> 00:06:18.934
(panting)

00:06:19.018 --> 00:06:21.437
(pants, exhales)

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:22.980
(panting)

00:06:23.063 --> 00:06:24.064
Food!

00:06:24.148 --> 00:06:25.774
Oh, I missed you so much.

00:06:25.858 --> 00:06:28.235
Look at me.
I've wasted away.

00:06:29.862 --> 00:06:30.988
Mmm, mmm.

00:06:31.071 --> 00:06:33.699
-(buzzing)
-(screams)

00:06:33.782 --> 00:06:35.367
(spits)

00:06:35.451 --> 00:06:37.077
Okay, snack time's over.

00:06:37.161 --> 00:06:38.162
We got to build a raft.

00:06:38.245 --> 00:06:39.371
Manny.

00:06:39.455 --> 00:06:41.749
Wow, Shira must really
hate building rafts.

00:06:42.833 --> 00:06:43.667
Go get her!

00:06:43.751 --> 00:06:45.627
-She can help us get back.
-Shira!

00:06:45.711 --> 00:06:47.546
(panting)

